WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.337
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.337 --> 00:08.041
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.041 --> 00:11.277
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.277 --> 00:14.280
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.280 --> 00:19.452
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:19.452 --> 00:22.255
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.255 --> 00:24.883
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.027 --> 00:29.329
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.329 --> 00:30.163
Don't cry!

00:30.163 --> 00:32.232
I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.232 --> 00:33.500
Huh?

00:33.500 --> 00:35.235
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.235 --> 00:36.836
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:36.836 --> 00:39.339
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.339 --> 00:40.640
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.640 --> 00:44.210
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.210 --> 00:46.312
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.312 --> 00:47.680
You mean her?!

00:47.680 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:52.852
Just like the princes

00:52.852 --> 00:55.422
who bravely face the enemies
no matter how ferocious they are

00:55.422 --> 00:58.224
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.224 --> 01:00.988
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.061 --> 01:13.640
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.640 --> 01:19.913
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.913 --> 01:26.152
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.152 --> 01:32.459
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.459 --> 01:38.731
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.731 --> 01:45.004
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.004 --> 01:51.277
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.277 --> 01:57.584
They say there is only one true love

01:57.584 --> 02:03.823
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.823 --> 02:10.063
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.063 --> 02:16.369
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.369 --> 02:22.642
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.642 --> 02:27.409
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:37.090 --> 02:39.125
I slept well!

02:39.125 --> 02:43.129
