03:01.314 --> 03:06.911
"Kiss? Baby? Lollipop!?"

03:07.654 --> 03:10.490
Geez, would you get used to that already?

03:10.490 --> 03:12.058
The fact that we are
living inside your room and...

03:12.058 --> 03:13.660
I can't get used to that!

03:13.660 --> 03:16.496
