but I forgot to bring it!

16:00.559 --> 16:03.462
Just wait a minute, okay!
I'll go get it real quick! Come!

16:03.462 --> 16:04.895
Ha!

16:06.665 --> 16:10.567
Here, check it out! Chinese style
almond jelly! What do you think?

16:11.770 --> 16:14.606
I-I've never seen such an object before!
Are we going to eat this?!

16:14.606 --> 16:16.375
That's right, Ichii-sama!

16:16.375 --> 16:18.644
If we hurry back to the magic world
and get married

16:18.644 --> 16:22.808
I will make this for you everyday and...

16:26.819 --> 16:29.982
And at our wedding everyone will...

16:32.358 --> 16:35.122
And our honeymoon will be...

16:37.730 --> 16:40.332
You! Why can't you be quiet?!

16:40.332 --> 16:41.700
What are you doing, Rokka?

16:41.700 --> 16:44.003
Th-That voice must be...

16:44.003 --> 16:45.337
I-Ichii-sama?!

16:45.337 --> 16:47.539
Hey, Rokka, is that a baby?

16:47.539 --> 16:49.174
Th-That's...

16:49.174 --> 16:54.009
Get a clue, Ichii! It's me, Nina!
Look at this! This!

16:55.080 --> 16:57.082
Th-That's right, she's a lost child!

16:57.082 --> 17:02.287
I happened to find a lost baby, so I need
to report this to the teachers now!

17:02.287 --> 17:04.089
What a second, Lady Rokka!

17:04.089 --> 17:06.992
There's a signal of the Crystal Pearl
coming from that baby.

17:06.992 --> 17:07.559
What?

17:07.559 --> 17:09.661
It's around here. It's around here.

17:09.661 --> 17:11.563
What? Then she is...

17:11.563 --> 17:13.298
Nina-chan?

17:13.298 --> 17:14.700
That is correct.

17:14.700 --> 17:16.568
Now I get it.

17:16.568 --> 17:21.473
You must have swallowed
the Crystal Pearl. I get it.

17:21.473 --> 17:24.777
No wonder Ichii-sama
is staying with you...

17:24.777 --> 17:28.881
He must be protecting you only
because you possess the Crystal Pearl.

17:28.881 --> 17:30.516
Ouch!

17:30.516 --> 17:36.255
Hey, Ichii-sama! If I take her back to the
magic world, I'm sure you'd be back, too!

17:36.255 --> 17:37.756
- Huh?
- Huh?

17:37.756 --> 17:40.626
Get them, Gou!

17:40.626 --> 17:43.495
As you wish, Lady Rokka.

17:43.495 --> 17:45.019
Phantom magic.

17:46.165 --> 17:47.928
Child Room.

18:00.279 --> 18:01.075
- What?
- What?

18:01.980 --> 18:02.981
What is this?

18:02.981 --> 18:05.451
Fight me, Ichii.

18:05.451 --> 18:11.123
If you can pick the real one out of all
of them we'll withdraw quietly for today.

18:11.123 --> 18:15.227
But if you can't we will take
the Crystal Pearl with us.

18:15.227 --> 18:17.896
If you really care for Nina,
not only the Pearl,

18:17.896 --> 18:24.995
I'm sure you'll be able to tell her
apart from the rest of them, correct?

18:26.972 --> 18:28.674
But easier said than done!

18:28.674 --> 18:31.043
How is it possible when a bunch of the
same looking ones are all over the place?

18:31.043 --> 18:34.570
I can't tell zura... I can't tell zura...

18:39.051 --> 18:41.178
Zura!!

18:43.856 --> 18:45.224
Zura... Zura...

18:45.224 --> 18:46.158
Zura!

18:46.158 --> 18:47.921
Zyuryuaaaaa!

18:51.697 --> 18:55.724
Don't come zura! Don't come zura!
Don't come near me zura!

18:59.872 --> 19:02.040
Nina-chan!

19:02.040 --> 19:05.277
Zero, you protect Zura
and I protect Nina!

19:05.277 --> 19:09.907
Huh? Oh... All righty! Leave it up to me!

19:26.798 --> 19:28.967
Destruction magic!

19:28.967 --> 19:30.832
Defense magic!

19:41.980 --> 19:44.676
Magic Cannon!

20:01.166 --> 20:02.929
Ichii...

20:05.871 --> 20:09.608
Nina-chan... I have found you.

20:09.608 --> 20:11.510
I have...

20:11.510 --> 20:14.104
Ichii... Ichii!

20:16.148 --> 20:17.316
Nina-chan!

20:17.316 --> 20:18.943
What? You mean her?

20:20.819 --> 20:24.823
Don't worry because I'm always with you.

20:24.823 --> 20:26.625
Ichii!

20:26.625 --> 20:30.796
That was the promise, Gou!
Nina-chan is back with us. All right?

20:30.796 --> 20:32.164
I guess there's no alternative.

20:32.164 --> 20:35.167
If we lose we return the girl to you.

20:35.167 --> 20:37.658
That was the promise we
made with you after all.

20:41.773 --> 20:46.511
No way! No! Why do I have to let a girl
like her steal my Ichii-sama?! Why?

20:46.511 --> 20:49.715
We lost. Come on, Lady Rokka.

20:49.715 --> 20:52.718
No! I don't want to let
that girl have my Ichii-sama!

20:52.718 --> 20:55.854
How could I let a girl like her...
How could I let a girl like her...

20:55.854 --> 20:58.948
Transform magic! Magical Forge!

21:07.399 --> 21:08.667
Ichii-sama?

21:08.667 --> 21:11.370
I've cast the defense magic
on the lollipop.

21:11.370 --> 21:14.373
I made it to where it'd activate
whenever Nina is in trouble.

21:14.373 --> 21:17.342
I'm sorry. I should've given you
a proper explanation ahead of time.

21:17.342 --> 21:19.678
Ichii, is that why you...

21:19.678 --> 21:22.180
Wh-Why would you help a woman like her?

21:22.180 --> 21:25.417
I'm a much, much,
much better woman than she is!

21:25.417 --> 21:28.318
And I care about Ichii-sama
far more than she does!

21:29.388 --> 21:34.026
It's because she's an
important person that I must protect!

21:34.026 --> 21:34.960
Zura!

21:34.960 --> 21:40.694
That's how much you care about this girl...
that's how much you... Ichii-sama...

21:44.036 --> 21:45.671
A kid?!

21:45.671 --> 21:49.374
That's right. She is really
a child who's 5 years old.

21:49.374 --> 21:53.145
I see! That's why Ichii was unfazed

21:53.145 --> 21:56.376
even when she kissed him and
didn't turn her away forcibly...

21:58.150 --> 22:00.719
I thought Ichii-sama would come back

22:00.719 --> 22:04.655
if she turned into a girl
who's smaller than me!

22:06.658 --> 22:10.696
I'm sorry, Rokka, but I can't
go back to the magic world.

22:10.696 --> 22:14.366
Because I have to protect Nina-chan
and make my dream come true.

22:14.366 --> 22:19.338
No! No! I want to be with Ichii-sama!
I want to be with you forever!

22:19.338 --> 22:21.740
Lady Rokka, let's go back.

22:21.740 --> 22:24.843
I will make cream stew for you tonight.

22:24.843 --> 22:26.011
Rokka.

22:26.011 --> 22:30.015
No, I don't care about that!
I will never give up!

22:30.015 --> 22:34.086
I will never give up on Ichii-sama!
Never! Never!

22:34.086 --> 22:35.420
Well...

22:35.420 --> 22:38.253
- Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama...
- lf you'll excuse us...

22:39.891 --> 22:43.028
- That's a wrap.
- It's not easy being a popular guy zura.

22:43.028 --> 22:44.129
Zura!

22:44.129 --> 22:45.391
Zura!

22:55.073 --> 22:57.442
Hey, Ichii, can I ask you a question?

22:57.442 --> 22:59.010
Hmm? What is it?

22:59.010 --> 23:01.847
How did you manage to find me, Ichii?

23:01.847 --> 23:06.284
Not even Hatsuka or You-chan
or Zero could figure it out.

23:06.284 --> 23:07.586
That's because...

23:07.586 --> 23:14.192
There were many babies, but you were
the only one who tried to save Zura.

23:14.192 --> 23:16.895
You're sweet, Nina-chan.

23:16.895 --> 23:18.597
Huh?

23:18.597 --> 23:20.258
You're sweet.

23:25.737 --> 23:30.509
- Hey, what are you doing? Let's go home!
You're taking too long!
- Oh, Zero.

23:30.509 --> 23:32.577
Let's go, Nina-chan!

23:32.577 --> 23:34.913
Yeah!

23:34.913 --> 23:40.146
- You're sweet, Nina-chan...
To anyone or anything.
- Hurry up! I'm starving!

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:01.973 --> 24:07.779
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.779 --> 24:13.585
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.585 --> 24:19.458
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.458 --> 24:25.363
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.363 --> 24:31.203
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.203 --> 24:39.678
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.678 --> 24:45.350
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.350 --> 24:51.656
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.656 --> 24:57.562
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.562 --> 25:03.335
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.335 --> 25:08.932
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.810 --> 25:13.612
Did you know that Nina-chan and the others

25:13.612 --> 25:14.946
are going to take a trip
to the hot spring!

25:14.946 --> 25:16.815
Hot spring?! That's our chance!

25:16.815 --> 25:19.518
Gou, did you hear that? We're going, too!

25:19.518 --> 25:21.920
So we can go after the Crystal Pearl
while they aren't looking, can't we?

25:21.920 --> 25:24.723
No, you're wrong! I don't know
what I would do

25:24.723 --> 25:26.992
if I let that Nina girl do this kind
of stuff or that kind of stuff to him!

25:26.992 --> 25:28.426
Lady Rokka, please calm down!

25:28.426 --> 25:31.763
Ichii-sama, I will protect you!

25:31.763 --> 25:36.268
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop,
"Exciting Hot Spring-Sexy Legend!?"

25:36.268 --> 25:38.236
Huh? What? What?!
